sentences.l:
The Master said: “The linen cap — that is the rites;
nowadays silk — it is economical;
I follow the many.”

The Master said: “The phoenix does not arrive,
the River does not bring forth the Chart;
I am at an end!”

Yan Yuan sighed heavily and said:
“I look up at it — ever higher;
I drill into it — ever harder;
I gaze at it, in front;
suddenly, behind.”

The Master said: “Going out, serving dukes and ministers;
coming in, serving father and elder brothers;
in matters of mourning, not daring not to do one's utmost;
not overcome by wine —
which of these is there in me?”

The Master, speaking of Yan Yuan, said: “What a pity!
I saw him advance;
I never saw him halt.”

The Master said: “The wise one is not led astray;
the humane one does not fret;
the brave one does not dread.”

The Master said: “One can study together with him,
yet not go to the Way with him;
one can go to the Way with him,
yet not stand firm with him;
one can stand firm with him,
yet not weigh with him.”
